From-The-Fog Datapack Code
==========================

The files in this directory (datapack/from-the-fog/) are derived from
LunarEclipseStudios' From-The-Fog Minecraft datapack:

  https://github.com/LunarEclipseStudios/From-The-Fog

These files are NOT part of the Herobrine: Haunting Fabric mod. They are
included here for reference and cross-project comparison only.

